desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"地图说明","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"map_desc","layout":"","data":"{\"list\":[{\"tab_name\":\"任务开始位置\",\"image\":\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2023/03/14/5700838/39e1655c17fb1b66c4113376c7e504ab_6574669655875519397.png\"}]}\n","style":""}],"id":"1371","is_customize_name":true,"is_abstract":false,"is_show_switch":false,"switch":false,"desc":"","repeated":false,"is_submodule":false,"origin_module_id":"0","without_border":false,"can_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"rich_text_editing":false},{"name":"剧情对话","is_poped":false,"components":[{"component_id":"collapse_panel","layout":"","data":"{\"rich_text\":\"\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size:22px\\\"\u003e〓路线攻略〓\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: left;\\\"\u003e具体路线攻略推荐：\u003ca href=\\\"https://www.miyoushe.com/ys/article/14173044\\\" data-type=\\\"a\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"\u003e凝光邀约攻略\u003c/a\u003e  作者：\u003ca href=\\\"https://www.miyoushe.com/ys/accountCenter/postList?id=82367888\\\" data-type=\\\"a\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\\\"\u003e橙柒柒\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size:19px\\\"\u003eEnd1 趁这光景正好\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2023/03/14/5700838/8ba65ab9547ccda415e5b871870dc781_4776489259665449671.png\\\" href=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"vertical-align:middle;\\\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(140,140,140,1)\\\"\u003e时光荏苒，芳华易逝，而「凝光」之名作为符号，会一直传承下去。\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size:19px\\\"\u003eEnd2 \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size:19px\\\"\u003e藏品之「重」\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2023/03/14/5700838/8a1f586924e0349f3ace8662fe71cf46_2966759099110458222.png\\\" href=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"vertical-align:middle;\\\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(140,140,140,1)\\\"\u003e在决战之时贡献了「重量」的物品，无论再小豆不可辜负。\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size:19px\\\"\u003eEnd3 \u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255)\\\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"font-size:19px\\\"\u003e不变的意志\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e\u003cimg src=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2023/03/14/5700838/6686454c6b50cc20e755a0048f5e548a_6203127223108993797.png\\\" href=\\\"\\\" style=\\\"vertical-align:middle;\\\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp style=\\\"white-space: pre-wrap; text-align: center;\\\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cspan style=\\\"color:rgba(140,140,140,1)\\\"\u003e纵有千般愁绪，此刻也云开雾散。展望前方，她一定会做出正确的决断。\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp sty